{
  "_why": "Starting recipe, to be tuned against bins/manifest.json (123 datasets, 7.71B training tokens, 78M validation). Shares are of budget_tokens; budget a group cannot absorb (tokens x max_epochs) is passed on to the others. Inside a group the budget is split across languages by UniMax with optional `language_weights` (English is 2-4x because it is also the general-capability language). `match` is a regex on the converter name; the first group that matches wins.",
